{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 16 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生理时序模型：门控、膨胀卷积、长状态与领域预训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Temporal Physiological AI</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_080_labram-title\">LaBraM</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以 VQ neural tokenizer 提供离散 EEG patch 目标，再用跨通道/时间 Transformer 做 masked code prediction。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Trains a vector-quantized (VQ) neural spectrum tokenizer to predict Fourier amplitude/phase spectra of EEG patches, then pretrains a cross-channel Transformer via masked code prediction.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">多通道连续 EEG 片段及通道身份</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Multi-channel continuous EEG recordings with arbitrary montage channel counts and recording lengths</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">通用 EEG 表征与下游分类/检测输出</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Universal EEG representation transferable across seizure detection, sleep staging, emotion, and motor BCI</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.iclr.cc/paper_files/paper/2024/file/47393e8594c82ce8fd83adc672cf9872-Paper-Conference.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_080_labram')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_080_labram')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"LaBraM original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/69adf2cfca7df91e8a09.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_080_labram', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_080_labram\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_080_labram')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_080_labram', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_080_labram\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">多通道 EEG</span><span class=\"lang-en\">channel EEG</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">不同 montage、记录长度和采样条件的脑电序列</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests multi-channel continuous eeg recordings with arbitrary montage channel counts and recording lengths and prepares initial tensor representations (channel EEG).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"不同 montage、记录长度和采样条件的脑电序列\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests multi-channel continuous eeg recordings with arbitrary montage channel counts and recording lengths and prepares initial tensor representations (channel EEG).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"多通道 EEG\" data-node-name-en=\"channel EEG\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_080_labram', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多通道 EEG</span><span class=\"lang-en\">channel EEG</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">不同 montage、记录长度和采样条件的脑电序列</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests multi-channel continuous eeg recordings with arbitrary montage channel counts and recording lengths and prepares initial tensor representations (channel EEG).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个通道沿时间切片并映射为 neural embeddings\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes channel patches to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"通道时间 patches\" data-node-name-en=\"channel patches\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_080_labram', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">通道时间 patches</span><span class=\"lang-en\">channel patches</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个通道沿时间切片并映射为 neural embeddings</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes channel patches to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"加入时间位置与电极/通道标识，保留 montage 结构\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 03 within the core eeg masked neural token transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"时空身份编码\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 03\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_080_labram', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">时空身份编码</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 03</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">加入时间位置与电极/通道标识，保留 montage 结构</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 03 within the core eeg masked neural token transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"向量量化网络把连续 EEG patch 编成离散 neural codes\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Neural tokenizer within the core eeg masked neural token transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Neural tokenizer\" data-node-name-en=\"Neural tokenizer\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_080_labram', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Neural tokenizer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">向量量化网络把连续 EEG patch 编成离散 neural codes</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Neural tokenizer within the core eeg masked neural token transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"遮挡部分 channel-time tokens，只给编码器可见上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Masked patches within the core eeg masked neural token transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Masked patches\" data-node-name-en=\"Masked patches\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_080_labram', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Masked patches</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">遮挡部分 channel-time tokens，只给编码器可见上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Masked patches within the core eeg masked neural token transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在跨通道、跨时间 token 上做 self-attention\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Transformer within the core eeg masked neural token transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"大规模 Transformer\" data-node-name-en=\"Transformer\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_080_labram', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">大规模 Transformer</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Transformer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在跨通道、跨时间 token 上做 self-attention</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Transformer within the core eeg masked neural token transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预测被遮挡位置的离散 tokenizer targets\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Code prediction within the core eeg masked neural token transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Code 预测头\" data-node-name-en=\"Code prediction\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_080_labram', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Code 预测头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Code prediction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预测被遮挡位置的离散 tokenizer targets</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Code prediction within the core eeg masked neural token transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对预训练 tokens 做分类、检测或 BCI 解码\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 08 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"下游任务头\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 08\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_080_labram', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">下游任务头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 08</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对预训练 tokens 做分类、检测或 BCI 解码</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 08 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"事件/状态标签或任务表征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces universal eeg representation transferable across seizure detection, sleep staging, emotion, and motor bci via EEG output.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"EEG 输出\" data-node-name-en=\"EEG output\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_080_labram', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">EEG 输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">EEG output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">事件/状态标签或任务表征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces universal eeg representation transferable across seizure detection, sleep staging, emotion, and motor bci via EEG output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"LaBraM Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · EEG patch 向量量化与遮挡神经码预测</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Fourier-Spectrum Guided Neural Vector Quantization + Symmetric Masked EEG Code Prediction</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"LaBraM：核心公式 · EEG patch 向量量化与遮挡神经码预测\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"80\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"22.39573pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.791958 -69.011212 288.427751 22.39573\" width=\"288.427751pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.441641-.992642L3.347448-1.028869C3.079363-.615873 2.98517-.550663 2.65912-.550663H.927432L2.144686-1.825881C2.78954-2.499718 3.072117-3.050381 3.072117-3.615534C3.072117-4.34009 2.485227-4.897998 1.731689-4.897998C1.333183-4.897998 .956414-4.738596 .688328-4.448774C.45647-4.202424 .347787-3.970567 .224612-3.456132L.376769-3.419904C.666591-4.129969 .927432-4.361827 1.427375-4.361827C2.036002-4.361827 2.448999-3.94883 2.448999-3.340203C2.448999-2.775049 2.115703-2.101212 1.507076-1.456357L.217367-.086947V0H3.043135L3.441641-.992642Z\" id=\"m080_g20-50\"></path><path d=\"M6.252918 0V-.137666C5.723992-.173893 5.622554-.275331 5.622554-.789766V-4.006794C5.622554-4.521229 5.716746-4.615421 6.252918-4.658895V-4.79656H4.811051L3.209783-1.137553L1.536059-4.79656H.101438V-4.658895C.695574-4.622667 .789766-4.53572 .789766-4.006794V-1.065097C.789766-.318805 .688328-.181139 .086947-.137666V0H1.789653V-.137666C1.231745-.166648 1.108571-.333296 1.108571-1.065097V-3.985058L2.927206 0H3.028644L4.883507-4.151706V-.869467C4.883507-.268086 4.79656-.173893 4.224161-.137666V0H6.252918Z\" id=\"m080_g20-77\"></path><path d=\"M5.122611-4.658895V-4.79656H3.419904V-4.658895C3.695235-4.637158 3.796673-4.608176 3.905357-4.542966C4.050268-4.441528 4.115478-4.180688 4.115478-3.731463V-1.28971L1.325937-4.79656H.086947V-4.658895C.398506-4.658895 .499944-4.60093 .789766-4.260389V-1.065097C.7