-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"74.643056\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g20-80\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"79.682945\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"83.528515\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g16-92\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"88.46001\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"95.043018\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g1-61\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"104.146586\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g10-0\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"113.61293\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g4-213\" y=\"-69.011212\"></use><use x=\"112.143222\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g13-56\" y=\"-46.934287\"></use><use x=\"115.201398\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g7-50\" y=\"-46.934287\"></use><use x=\"119.972295\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g7-77\" y=\"-46.934287\"></use><use x=\"129.923591\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g23-108\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"132.693204\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g23-111\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"137.674524\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g23-103\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"145.043516\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g16-63\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"151.114252\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g13-92\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"156.68939\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g4-0\" y=\"-66.410963\"></use><use x=\"160.046795\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g16-73\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"164.221138\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g13-56\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"170.506914\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g10-106\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"176.39255\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g16-63\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"181.772375\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g7-110\" y=\"-57.186323\"></use><use x=\"185.554198\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g7-77\" y=\"-57.186323\"></use><use x=\"194.343215\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"198.713435\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g16-50\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"203.495507\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g13-56\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"206.615445\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"210.836231\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g16-67\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"213.904721\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g13-56\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"217.223916\" xlink:href=\"#m080_g4-1\" y=\"-66.410963\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">电极数、记录长度和任务差异使一任务一模型难迁移</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">EEG datasets vary wildly in electrode montage (16 to 128 channels), sampling rates, and low SNR, preventing cross-dataset pretraining.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以 channel patches、VQ neural tokenizer 和 masked code prediction 统一异质 EEG</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Segment each EEG channel into fixed-duration temporal patches, learn a discrete neural codebook predicting frequency amplitude/phase, and pretrain a Transformer with spatial+temporal embeddings via masked code prediction.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">跨约 20 个数据集、约 2500 小时 EEG 预训练离散神经信号 tokenizer 与 Transformer</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Spectrum-guided discrete neural tokenizer + factorized electrode-spatial and temporal embeddings unifying ~2,500 hours across 20 heterogeneous EEG cohorts.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">支持 EEG 分类、检测和 BCI 的迁移与少样本学习</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Canonical foundation model for cross-montage EEG abnormality classification, event detection, and brain–computer interfaces.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">原论文在四类下游任务报告优势；跨设备、跨人群和独立临床验证仍不足</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Significant methodological leap for heterogeneous neurophysiology; clinical cross-hospital sensitivity and false-alarm calibration require ongoing validation.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把异质 EEG 统一为 channel-time patches，并显式编码电极身份与时间位置。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">VQ neural tokenizer 将连续信号变为离散语义目标，使 masked modeling 不必逐样本回归原始振幅。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">大规模 Transformer 在跨时间和跨通道维度共享参数，迁移能力依赖 montage 与预处理对齐。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Segment each EEG channel into fixed-duration temporal patches, learn a discrete neural codebook predicting frequency amplitude/phase, and pretrain a Transformer with spatial+temporal embeddings via masked code prediction.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Spectrum-guided discrete neural tokenizer + factorized electrode-spatial and temporal embeddings unifying ~2,500 hours across 20 heterogeneous EEG cohorts.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Fourier-Spectrum Guided Neural Vector Quantization + Symmetric Masked EEG Code Prediction.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可迁移到 EEG 分类、事件检测和 BCI 的少标签任务，是领域预训练的重要代表。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">跨设备、跨人群、缺失电极和独立临床队列证据仍有限；离散 tokenizer 也可能忽略低幅但关键事件。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Canonical foundation model for cross-montage EEG abnormality classification, event detection, and brain–computer interfaces.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Significant methodological leap for heterogeneous neurophysiology; clinical cross-hospital sensitivity and false-alarm calibration require ongoing validation.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.iclr.cc/paper_files/paper/2024/file/47393e8594c82ce8fd83adc672cf9872-Paper-Conference.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Large Brain Model for Learning Generic Representations with Tremendous EEG Data in BCI</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/935963004/LaBraM\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}